---
---
<section id="about" class="py-32 lg:py-40">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-start">
      <!-- Left: Label + Pull quote -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="section-label mb-8">About</div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold max-w-sm" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--color-text-primary)">
          AI-augmented engineer. One hire, the output of an entire team.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Bio + Stats — glass card -->
      <div class="reveal rounded-[var(--radius-2xl)] p-8" style="
        background: var(--glass-base);
        backdrop-filter: var(--blur-md);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--blur-md);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-top-color: var(--color-border-light);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-glass-base);
      ">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary)">
          I use AI across every stage of development — architecture, coding, testing, deployment. This lets me build any kind of application, migrate large legacy codebases to modern stacks, and automate entire developer workflows. Hiring me is equivalent to hiring 10-20 developers.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-12" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary)">
          Deep expertise in Flutter, Angular, NestJS, and cloud platforms, now supercharged with AI tooling. Currently leading mobile development for fintech projects in the Middle East while building AI-accelerated development pipelines.
        </p>

        <!-- Stats row -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-8 pt-8" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border)">
          <div class="stagger-child reveal">
            <div class="font-display font-bold mb-1" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--color-accent)">10-20x</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--color-text-muted)">Developer Output</div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-px hidden sm:block" style="background: var(--color-border)"></div>
          <div class="stagger-child reveal">
            <div class="font-display font-bold mb-1" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--color-accent)">8+</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--color-text-muted)">Projects Shipped</div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-px hidden sm:block" style="background: var(--color-border)"></div>
          <div class="stagger-child reveal">
            <div class="font-display font-bold mb-1" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--color-accent)">4+</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--color-text-muted)">Years Experience</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
